{
  "name": "Hydrosophic Shield",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to summon up your water-based defenses at a split-second's notice.</p><p>When you are hit by an attack or subject to an effect that forces you to make a Dexterity Saving Throw, you can use your Reaction to create a shield of water around you, granting yourself half-cover until the start of your next turn.</p><p>This cover applies even when against effects that normally ignore cover.</p>",
